                detail: 
                    `<h3>Everything in design has a sort of 'weight' to it. A deep red is fairly 'heavy', but a light gray is, well, 'light'.</h3><br>
                    Balancing these weights are fairly important to design. Sometimes it's okay to intentionally imbalance the weights if that's your style, but it's
