                detail: `<h2>Space in design is literally what the word means. It's space.</h2><br>
                In specific, it's called negative space. Where there's nothing in an image. Pretty much just a solid color.<br>
                It's used most commonly in logos. Not too much, not too little, just enough to make it roomy, but not too roomy.<br>
                <br>
                <b>Examples:</b><br><br><br>
